      It depends upon how badly you want to know.  There is a fairly
straightforward way for this particular case:  play in explore mode
and frequently use the <ctrl/X> command to check your attributes.
(Using wizard mode would give more specific details for some of the
attributes--including luck and alignment--but isn't really necessary
for this.)  In regular play you'd need to use potions or wands of
enlightenment (or invoke one of the quest artifacts) to do this, and
most likely won't have enough of such items to check enough times.


